{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development owing to the overall mass, bulk, and design of the roof extensions combined with the two-storey side extension accentuated by solar panels, would result in a disproportionate and visually intrusive development. This would be out of character with the host dwelling and the surrounding area. Given its high visibility from Manor Drive, the proposal would negatively impact the existing street scene's character and appearance, conflicting with Paragraph 135 of the National Planning Policy Framework 2024, Policies D3 of the London Plan 2021, and Policy DM10 of the Council's Core Strategy 2012.\r"
